            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Troop Movement"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Whenever the soul swarm Strides, the soul swarm first Forms Up as a free action to condense into a 20-foot-by-20-foot area (minus any missing squares), then moves. This works just like a Gargantuan creature moving; for instance, if any square of the soul swarm enters 3, the extra movement cost applies to the whole soul swarm."
            },
