              "value": "Soul Grasp"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe soul swarm reaches out and tries to tear at the spiritual energy of enemies within 5 feet (DC 32 basic Reflex save). The soul swarm can choose to deal slashing damage as it cuts away at a creature, fire damage as it burns other souls away, or negative damage as it attempts to unmake a soul. The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n1 2d6+1 damage 2 4d6+11 damage 3 6d6+11 damage"
